WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.832
"Whitetip sharks! Oh no!" Mo cried.

2
00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:09.686
"Don't worry," Cora said.

3
00:00:09.687 --> 00:00:12.678
"I can protect the reef."

4
00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:16.305
"Thanks, Cora!" Rita said.

5
00:00:16.306 --> 00:00:20.624
"I can help too," Stan said.

6
00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:25.600
Cora frowned. "I don't need your help.

7
00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:28.882
I can take care of this myself."

8
00:00:28.883 --> 00:00:33.654
Stan swam around her.

9
00:00:33.655 --> 00:00:38.375
"But I'm smart, and I'm the best hider!"

10
00:00:38.376 --> 00:00:41.903
"No, you're not!" Cora said.

11
00:00:41.904 --> 00:00:51.427
"And I'm the one who protects the reef!"

12
00:00:51.428 --> 00:00:54.851
Cora swam toward the compass shell.

13
00:00:54.852 --> 00:00:59.129
Mo followed—and so did Stan.

14
00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:03.466
"Go away, Stan!" Cora said.

15
00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:09.622
"But I'm brave and smart!" Stan said. "Maybe

16
00:01:09.623 --> 00:01:13.258
we do need help," Mo whispered. "Whitetip

17
00:01:13.259 --> 00:01:17.229
sharks are dangerous!" "Not

18
00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:21.087
from him ," Cora said.

19
00:01:21.088 --> 00:01:33.902
"The compass will tell us what we need."

20
00:01:33.903 --> 00:01:38.805
Cora and Mo reached the shell.

21
00:01:38.806 --> 00:01:49.087
"Stan is gone!" Cora said. "Finally!"

22
00:01:49.088 --> 00:01:52.021
Suddenly Stan popped out from behind a rock.

23
00:01:52.022 --> 00:01:53.291
"Boo!"

24
00:01:53.292 --> 00:01:57.700
"Ahh!" Mo jumped.

25
00:01:57.701 --> 00:02:06.306
Stan laughed. "See? I'm good at hiding."

26
00:02:06.307 --> 00:02:09.981
"We don't need your help," Cora said.

27
00:02:09.982 --> 00:02:19.999
"I'll show you."

28
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.288
Cora's ink opened the shell.

29
00:02:23.289 --> 00:02:26.952
"Oh no!" she cried.

30
00:02:26.953 --> 00:02:31.939
Inside was a picture of Stan!

